{"title":"Lord Kael the Wyrmbreaker","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Lord Kael the Wyrmbreaker is a named <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-lord\">Virikh Lord</a> seen at level 59.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Lord Kael the Wyrmbreaker</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2030, 276</li><li>in the wilds around 2024, 276</li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"lord-kael-the-wyrmbreaker\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"shagbark-bow\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6ad40ed0b4459385c272.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shagbark Bow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Virikh Lords</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/lord-vorhal-the-dragonbane\">Lord Vorhal the Dragonbane</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/1f6bd03b8107c4b5690b.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Lord Kael the Wyrmbreaker</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/virikh-lord\">Virikh Lord</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>59</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>1,320</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>133 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}